      50.88,
      379.28,
      539.64,
      481.28
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 57 of the Ceylon Electricity Board Act No. 17 of 1969, I, Ranjith Siyambalapitiya, Minister of Power & Renewable Energy do by this order, approve the proposed acquisition of lands required by the Ceylon Electricity Board and described in the schedule hereto. Ranjith Siyambalapitiya, Minister of Power & Renewable Energy. 16 August 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      482.96,
      539.64,
      561.92
    ],
    "text": "Schedule THE land situated in the village of Kannanthudawa in Grama Niladari\u2019s Division of 652 Kannanthudawa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Millaniya in the Munwaththebage pattu of Raigam Korale, in the Administrative District of Kalutara, in the Province of Western of Sri Lanka containing in extent of 0A, 3R, 28.5P shown in the Plan No. 1739 dated 15.01.1930 Prepared by Licensed Surveyor Mr. J. R. A. Rodrigo Bounded as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      563.36,
      488.04,
      659.6
    ],
    "text": "North by : Lot C in the Plan No. 1739; East by : Low land; South East by : Low land and Lot E in the Plan No. 1739; South West by : Cart Road; West by : Yatawarage Mahawatta; Claimed by : Present Incumbent of the Lankathilaka Viharaya at No. 277, Arakagoda Millaniya. 09-44",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
